---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
{% set prefix = "/en" if lang == "en" else "" %}
<main id="main-content">
  <section class="page-hero" style="--hero-image: url('/images/web/product-parts.jpg')">
    <div class="container page-hero-inner">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="{{ prefix }}/">{% if lang == "en" %}Home{% else %}首页{% endif %}</a><span>/</span><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Products{% else %}产品目录{% endif %}</span></nav>
      <span class="eyebrow">PRODUCT DIRECTORY</span>
      <h1>{% if lang == "en" %}Industrial knives organized by equipment and application.{% else %}按设备与应用组织工业刀具。{% endif %}</h1>
      <p>{% if lang == "en" %}Use the directory to identify the closest blade family, then send a drawing, old blade, photo or operating condition for manufacturing review.{% else %}先从目录找到接近的刀具类别，再用图纸、旧刀、照片或工况进入制造评估。{% endif %}</p>
      <div class="page-hero-actions"><a class="button button-dark" href="{{ prefix }}/rfq/">{% if lang == "en" %}Start RFQ{% else %}开始询价{% endif %}</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="product-grid">
        {% for product in catalog.products %}
          {% include "partials/product-card.njk" %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-grid">
        <div class="content-block"><span class="eyebrow">SELECTION LOGIC</span><h2>{% if lang == "en" %}A product name is only the starting point.{% else %}产品名称只是起点。{% endif %}</h2><p>{% if lang == "en" %}The same general blade type can require a different material, heat-treatment route, edge geometry or inspection plan depending on the machine and material cut.{% else %}同一种通用刀型，面对不同设备和被切材料，可能需要不同材料、热处理、刃口或检测方案。{% endif %}</p></div>
        <div class="notice">{% if lang == "en" %}Specific hardness, tolerance, lead time and service-life claims are provided only after drawing and application review.{% else %}具体硬度、公差、交期和寿命承诺只在图纸与工况评估后提供。{% endif %}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  {% include "partials/rfq-cta.njk" %}
</main>
